  "prefLabel": "Rev 903.01 Forgiveness of Debt",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 903.01 Forgiveness of Debt. Forgiveness, in whole or in part, of a shareholder's or interest-holder's debt by the organization shall be a dividend to the shareholder or interest-holder for purposes of the interest and dividends tax to the extent of that organization's accumulated profits.\n\nSource. #2228, eff 12-28-82; ss by #2881, eff 10-19-84; ss by #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
